{
  "_readme": [
    "\u00a719 click-to-edit: text widgets that render the operator's words but expose",
    "NO hotspot on the canvas ([data-field] / [data-field-jump] / EditableText).",
    "Read by src/components/widgets/__tests__/widget-hotspots.test.tsx, which",
    "MOUNTS every text-bearing variant through the real WidgetPreview path.",
    "",
    "THIS LIST ONLY RATCHETS DOWN. A text widget that is not listed here and has",
    "zero hotspots fails the suite; a listed one that GAINS a hotspot also fails",
    "until its entry is deleted, so a fix cannot silently regress later.",
    "",
    "Captured 2026-09-11 at 101 of 239 text-bearing variants (42%) \u2014 found by",
    "driving the builder, not by reading source. The operator's report was",
    "'the widgets still arent editable', and on this evidence he was right well",
    "beyond the four widgets fixed that day. The clusters, largest first:",
    "  37 TICKER      \u2014 render messages.join(...); want data-field-jump",
    "  24 CALENDAR    \u2014 render an event list; want data-field-jump",
    "   9 RICH_TEXT   \u2014 single string config; want a real inline edit",
    "   7 ANNOUNCEMENT / 7 STAFF_SPOTLIGHT / 7 TEXT",
    "   6 LUNCH_MENU / 3 COUNTDOWN / 1 BELL_SCHEDULE",
    "",
    "Fixing one is: wrap its operator-owned text in EditableText (a single",
    "string config) or mark the rendered block data-field-jump=\"<key>\" (a LIST,",
    "where typing over the join would destroy every row), then delete its id."
  ],
